            date: 'The Sumerian poem is known from Old Babylonian manuscripts of c. 1800 BC, chiefly from Nippur and Ur, and is presumably older; the Akkadian poem survives in first-millennium copies from Ashur and Nineveh and was probably composed in the later second millennium — a thousand years and more between the two.',
